# GitHub linguist: 指定真实语言
# Chrono-shift 主要是 C++ (45%) + Rust (25%) + C (15%) + JS/CSS (10%)

# 标记所有 Makefile 为 generated (不计入语言统计)
Makefile linguist-generated
**/Makefile linguist-generated
Makefile.* linguist-generated
**/Makefile.* linguist-generated
*.mk linguist-generated

# 标记构建脚本
*.cmake linguist-generated

# 标记 Rust build 产物
*.o linguist-generated
*.d linguist-generated
*.rmeta linguist-generated
*.rlib linguist-generated
*.timestamp linguist-generated
CACHEDIR.TAG linguist-generated
.cargo-lock linguist-generated
.rustc_info.json linguist-generated

# 标记生成的代码
**/generated/** linguist-generated

# C++ 源码 (主要语言)
*.cpp linguist-detectable
*.hpp linguist-detectable
*.h linguist-detectable

# Rust 源码 (第二语言)
*.rs linguist-detectable

# C 源码
*.c linguist-detectable

# Web UI
*.js linguist-detectable
*.css linguist-detectable
*.html linguist-detectable

# Python scripts
*.py linguist-detectable

# 文档
*.md linguist-documentation
